Package: libwnck-3-0
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libwnck-3-common
Description: Window Navigator Construction Kit - runtime files
 A library to use for writing pagers and task lists.
 .
 This package contains runtime files.

